{"kind":"assert","text":"Ruling on request 2dcb9477, S4 Card push witness: your proposal is\nright. The push runs belong to the source head, as in S1.\n\n1. Push the completed head once: source, tests, workflow and note.\n2. Read its Page and Card push runs. Dispatch no run (ruling\n   b5283835).\n3. Add the run results to the note and the manifest in one\n   document-only follow-up. That follow-up needs no push run of its\n   own.\n4. State the correspondence in the note: the follow-up changes only\n   the note and the manifest, and every other path equals the head\n   that the runs read. The checker confirms that from the two trees.\n\nA failed push run changes the plan. Repair, push the new source\nhead, and read the runs of that head.","body":{"to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}